-- Scripts the 2026-11-05 quest restore (2026_11_05_99) wiped, put back as the files after it leave them.
-- That restore was made by comparing two test worlds, but the classic script files that write through a `world.` schema
-- prefix (2026_09_28_15 vanilla SmartAI, 2026_10_11_24 summoned creature AI, 2026_10_12_30/31/33/34 VMaNGOS event and
-- gameobject scripts) never reached its reference world, so it deleted their rows and reset what they had set:
--  - 121 smart script entries (353 rows): the BRD Shadowforge Lock -> giant door (BUGS-ALL row 299), the Scarlet Monastery,
--    Deadmines, Shadowfang Keep and Scholomance door levers and torches, the Scholomance shadow portal gates and Mausoleum,
--    Sharpbeak's cage, the Arathi Stones of Binding, the Barrens valves, the Uldaman Runed Pedestal and Shadowforge Cache,
--    the UBRS Emberseer doors, Vaelastrasz / Gyth and Urok events, The Binding, Free Knot!, and VMaNGOS EventAI of
--    Kirtonos, General Rajaxx, the Edge of Madness bosses, the Blackhand Incarcerators, the Pyrewood councilmen and others;
--  - gameobject AIName of the levers and torches, the Stratholme Service Entrance script, General Rajaxx's AIName and
--    the SmartQuest script of quest 5525.
-- Rows are written exactly as the files before and after 2026_11_05_99 leave them (door lists in the 2026_11_22_47 form).
-- Left as the restore wrote them: Sneed 643 and Aku'mai Servant 4978 (the EG live abilities replaced their spell lists),
-- Aquementas 9453 and every other entry the restore wrote new rows for. Safe to run again.
